<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2621539053"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1763788608"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="憂、燦々"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ヨルシカ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="もしも生まれ変わったならそっとこんな声になって"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:09.100"><div begin="00:13.075" end="03:32.334"><p begin="00:13.075" end="00:27.396" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:13.075" end="00:15.304">小さな約束</span><span begin="00:15.304" end="00:16.232">も</span><span begin="00:17.400" end="00:18.200">守</span><span begin="00:18.200" end="00:19.340">れないか</span><span begin="00:19.340" end="00:20.005">ら</span> <span begin="00:21.772" end="00:22.874">大きな</span><span begin="00:22.874" end="00:23.690">欠伸</span><span begin="00:23.690" end="00:24.381">で</span><span begin="00:24.690" end="00:25.823">ごまかし</span><span begin="00:25.823" end="00:26.639">ていた</span><span begin="00:26.639" end="00:27.396">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连一个小小的约定也无法遵守</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi i sa na ya ku so ku mo ma mo re na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:30.343" end="00:44.313" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:30.343" end="00:31.503">小さな</span><span begin="00:31.503" end="00:32.322">幸</span><span begin="00:32.322" end="00:32.570">せ</span><span begin="00:32.570" end="00:33.671">も</span><span begin="00:34.436" end="00:36.703">見つけられないか</span><span begin="00:36.703" end="00:37.494">ら</span> <span begin="00:38.769" end="00:39.855">大きな</span><span begin="00:39.855" end="00:40.697">目から</span><span begin="00:40.697" end="00:41.775">涙を</span><span begin="00:42.002" end="00:43.402">流してた</span><span begin="00:43.402" end="00:44.313">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连一个小小的幸福也无处可循</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi i sa na shi a wa se mo mi tsu ke ra re na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:45.578" end="00:53.701" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:45.578" end="00:46.687">愛しい</span><span begin="00:46.687" end="00:47.455">だけじゃ</span><span begin="00:47.455" end="00:47.722">足</span><span begin="00:47.722" end="00:48.820">りない</span><span begin="00:48.820" end="00:49.354">し</span> <span begin="00:49.922" end="00:50.906">嬉しい</span><span begin="00:50.906" end="00:51.759">だけじゃ</span><span begin="00:51.759" end="00:53.141">不安だ</span><span begin="00:53.141" end="00:53.701">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅有爱怜之意并不足够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i to shi i da ke ja ta ri na i shi</span></p><p begin="00:54.199" end="00:59.618" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:54.199" end="00:55.295">優しい</span><span begin="00:55.295" end="00:56.114">だけ</span><span begin="00:56.114" end="00:56.567">じゃ</span><span begin="00:56.882" end="00:57.733">意味</span><span begin="00:57.733" end="00:58.250">ない</span><span begin="00:58.250" end="00:59.618">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅有温柔小意也毫无意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi i da ke ja i mi na i shi</span></p><p begin="01:00.668" end="01:04.853" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="01:00.668" end="01:01.444">連れて行っ</span><span begin="01:01.444" end="01:01.745">てあ</span><span begin="01:01.745" end="01:02.193">げるか</span><span begin="01:02.193" end="01:02.604">ら</span> <span begin="01:02.828" end="01:04.196">憂、</span><span begin="01:04.196" end="01:04.853">燦々</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你一同出发</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu re te i 't te a ge ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:04.983" end="01:13.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:04.983" end="01:05.473">離さない</span><span begin="01:05.473" end="01:05.772">でい</span><span begin="01:05.772" end="01:06.540">てくれるな</span><span begin="01:06.540" end="01:06.711">ら</span> <span begin="01:06.924" end="01:07.973">何でも</span><span begin="01:07.973" end="01:09.764">叶えてあげ</span><span begin="01:09.764" end="01:10.629">る</span><span begin="01:10.932" end="01:11.482">か</span><span begin="01:11.482" end="01:13.420">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要你愿意不离不弃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na sa na i de i te ku re ru na ra</span></p><p begin="01:13.609" end="01:17.794" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="01:13.609" end="01:14.385">連れて行っ</span><span begin="01:14.385" end="01:14.686">てあ</span><span begin="01:14.686" end="01:15.134">げるか</span><span begin="01:15.134" end="01:15.545">ら</span> <span begin="01:15.769" end="01:17.137">憂、</span><span begin="01:17.137" end="01:17.794">燦々</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你一同出发</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu re te i 't te a ge ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:17.876" end="01:26.773" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:17.876" end="01:18.509">離さない</span><span begin="01:18.509" end="01:18.759">でい</span><span begin="01:18.759" end="01:19.477">てくれるな</span><span begin="01:19.477" end="01:19.697">ら</span> <span begin="01:19.877" end="01:20.893">何でも</span><span begin="01:20.893" end="01:22.728">叶えてあげ</span><span begin="01:22.728" end="01:23.734">る</span><span begin="01:26.104" end="01:26.387">か</span><span begin="01:26.387" end="01:26.773">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要你愿意不离不弃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na sa na i de i te ku re ru na ra</span></p><p begin="01:39.575" end="01:53.867" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:39.575" end="01:41.754">これからあたした</span><span begin="01:41.754" end="01:42.839">ち</span><span begin="01:44.455" end="01:46.138">どうなるのか</span><span begin="01:46.138" end="01:46.972">な</span> <span begin="01:47.989" end="01:50.157">今どうでもいい</span><span begin="01:50.157" end="01:50.857">事</span><span begin="01:51.208" end="01:52.072">考</span><span begin="01:52.072" end="01:53.122">えてたで</span><span begin="01:53.122" end="01:53.867">しょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今后的我们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko re ka ra a ta shi ta chi</span></p><p begin="01:56.867" end="02:05.055" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:56.867" end="01:58.003">憎しみ</span><span begin="01:58.003" end="01:58.803">だけじゃ</span><span begin="01:58.803" end="01:59.104">キ</span><span begin="01:59.104" end="01:59.508">リ</span><span begin="01:59.508" end="02:00.187">ない</span><span begin="02:00.187" end="02:00.750">し</span> <span begin="02:01.237" end="02:02.285">悲しい</span><span begin="02:02.285" end="02:03.104">だけじゃ</span><span begin="02:03.104" end="02:04.485">不満だ</span><span begin="02:04.485" end="02:05.055">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅有怨恨之心将循环无尽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ku shi mi da ke ja ki ri na i shi</span></p><p begin="02:05.551" end="02:11.105" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="02:05.551" end="02:06.639">厳しい</span><span begin="02:06.639" end="02:07.471">だけ</span><span begin="02:07.471" end="02:07.874">じゃ</span><span begin="02:08.256" end="02:08.523">笑</span><span begin="02:08.523" end="02:09.056">み</span><span begin="02:09.056" end="02:09.640">ない</span><span begin="02:09.640" end="02:11.105">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅有严厉肃穆便欠缺笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki bi shi i da ke ja e mi na i shi</span></p><p begin="02:11.985" end="02:16.264" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="02:11.985" end="02:12.820">連れて行っ</span><span begin="02:12.820" end="02:13.086">てあ</span><span begin="02:13.086" end="02:13.587">げるか</span><span begin="02:13.587" end="02:13.937">ら</span> <span begin="02:14.204" end="02:14.477">こっ</span><span begin="02:14.477" end="02:15.202">ちにおいで</span><span begin="02:15.202" end="02:15.553">よ</span><span begin="02:15.553" end="02:15.854">ダー</span><span begin="02:15.854" end="02:16.264">リン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你一同出发</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu re te i 't te a ge ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:16.346" end="02:24.727" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="02:16.346" end="02:16.855">離さない</span><span begin="02:16.855" end="02:17.153">でい</span><span begin="02:17.153" end="02:17.871">てくれるな</span><span begin="02:17.871" end="02:18.138">ら</span> <span begin="02:18.287" end="02:19.305">いつでも</span><span begin="02:19.305" end="02:21.121">許してあげ</span><span begin="02:21.121" end="02:21.962">る</span><span begin="02:22.330" end="02:22.879">か</span><span begin="02:22.879" end="02:24.727">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要你愿意不离不弃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na sa na i de i te ku re ru na ra</span></p><p begin="02:24.965" end="02:29.221" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="02:24.965" end="02:25.813">連れて行っ</span><span begin="02:25.813" end="02:26.095">てあ</span><span begin="02:26.095" end="02:26.562">げるか</span><span begin="02:26.562" end="02:26.933">ら</span> <span begin="02:27.197" end="02:27.429">こっ</span><span begin="02:27.429" end="02:28.146">ちにおいで</span><span begin="02:28.146" end="02:28.543">よ</span><span begin="02:28.543" end="02:28.813">ダー</span><span begin="02:28.813" end="02:29.221">リン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你一同出发</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu re te i 't te a ge ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:29.221" end="02:38.261" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="02:29.221" end="02:29.872">離さない</span><span begin="02:29.872" end="02:30.157">でい</span><span begin="02:30.157" end="02:30.856">てくれるな</span><span begin="02:30.856" end="02:31.080">ら</span> <span begin="02:31.240" end="02:32.272">いつでも</span><span begin="02:32.272" end="02:34.067">許してあげ</span><span begin="02:34.067" end="02:35.006">る</span><span begin="02:37.488" end="02:37.720">か</span><span begin="02:37.720" end="02:38.261">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要你愿意不离不弃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na sa na i de i te ku re ru na ra</span></p><p begin="02:39.045" end="02:45.133" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="02:39.045" end="02:40.082">どこにで</span><span begin="02:40.082" end="02:40.730">も</span> <span begin="02:41.250" end="02:42.200">どこにで</span><span begin="02:42.200" end="02:42.898">も</span> <span begin="02:43.400" end="02:44.384">どこにで</span><span begin="02:44.384" end="02:45.133">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论在哪里 无论在哪里 无论在哪里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ni de mo do ko ni de mo do ko ni de mo</span></p><p begin="02:45.546" end="02:52.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:45.546" end="02:46.554">どこにいて</span><span begin="02:46.554" end="02:47.234">も</span> <span begin="02:47.703" end="02:48.682">どこにいて</span><span begin="02:48.682" end="02:49.538">も</span> <span begin="02:49.944" end="02:50.896">どこにいて</span><span begin="02:50.896" end="02:52.570">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论身处何方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ni i te mo</span></p><p begin="02:53.086" end="02:55.693" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:53.086" end="02:53.931">連れて行っ</span><span begin="02:53.931" end="02:54.766">てあげるか</span><span begin="02:54.766" end="02:55.693">ら…</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你一同出发</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu re te i 't te a ge ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:57.299" end="02:59.677" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:57.299" end="02:59.051">離さないでいてくれるな</span><span begin="02:59.051" end="02:59.677">ら…</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要你愿意不离不弃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na sa na i de i te ku re ru na ra</span></p><p begin="03:06.054" end="03:10.239" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="03:06.054" end="03:06.830">連れて行っ</span><span begin="03:06.830" end="03:07.131">てあ</span><span begin="03:07.131" end="03:07.579">げるか</span><span begin="03:07.579" end="03:07.990">ら</span> <span begin="03:08.214" end="03:09.582">憂、</span><span begin="03:09.582" end="03:10.239">燦々</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你一同出发</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu re te i 't te a ge ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:10.369" end="03:18.848" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="03:10.369" end="03:10.988">離さない</span><span begin="03:10.988" end="03:11.239">でい</span><span begin="03:11.239" end="03:11.956">てくれるな</span><span begin="03:11.956" end="03:12.158">ら</span> <span begin="03:12.305" end="03:13.372">何でも</span><span begin="03:13.372" end="03:15.188">叶えてあげ</span><span begin="03:15.188" end="03:15.993">る</span><span begin="03:16.415" end="03:16.948">か</span><span begin="03:16.948" end="03:18.848">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要你愿意不离不弃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na sa na i de i te ku re ru na ra</span></p><p begin="03:19.066" end="03:23.251" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="03:19.066" end="03:19.842">連れて行っ</span><span begin="03:19.842" end="03:20.143">てあ</span><span begin="03:20.143" end="03:20.591">げるか</span><span begin="03:20.591" end="03:21.002">ら</span> <span begin="03:21.226" end="03:22.594">憂、</span><span begin="03:22.594" end="03:23.251">燦々</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你一同出发</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu re te i 't te a ge ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:23.343" end="03:32.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="03:23.343" end="03:23.963">離さない</span><span begin="03:23.963" end="03:24.211">でい</span><span begin="03:24.211" end="03:24.944">てくれるな</span><span begin="03:24.944" end="03:25.161">ら</span> <span begin="03:25.328" end="03:26.360">何でも</span><span begin="03:26.360" end="03:28.160">叶えてあげ</span><span begin="03:28.160" end="03:29.019">る</span><span begin="03:31.518" end="03:31.785">か</span><span begin="03:31.785" end="03:32.334">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要你愿意不离不弃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na sa na i de i te ku re ru na ra</span></p></div></body></tt>